{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"```systemverilog\nmodule counter_12 (\n    input  logic       rst_n,\n    input  logic       clk,\n    input  logic       valid_count,\n    output logic [3:0] out\n);\n\n    always_ff @(posedge clk or negedge rst_n) begin\n        if (!rst_n)\n            out <= 4'b0000;\n        else if (valid_count) begin\n            if (out == 4'd11)\n                out <= 4'b0000;\n            else\n                out <= out + 4'd1;\n        end\n    end\n\nendmodule\n```"}}
